Subject: [PATCH 1573/3799] soh: rename func_80A405CC -> EnGo_Uncurl

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: plays the uncurl animation forward to its last frame, then installs either the standing idle or the Goron-City-doors variant.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c
index dd576b464..a290d972f 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c
@@ -25,7 +25,8 @@ void EnGo_WakeUp(EnGo* this, PlayState* play);
 
